{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14223140","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14223140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1422314001:1":{"text":"연회가 끝난 다음 날 아침","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9427B363A01709C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422314002:1":{"text":"마법사님, 작별 인사를 전하러 왔어요.","source_cn":"魔法师<male>先生</male><female>小...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB71EB71A67E359F0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마법사님, 작별 인사를 전하러 왔어요.","female":"마법사님, 작별 인사를 전하러 왔어요.","variant_male_record_index":"163753","variant_female_record_index":"163754","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422314003:1":{"text":"네?! 이제 막 집에 돌아왔는데 이렇게나 빨리 가신다고요!","source_cn":"欸？！你刚回家，这么快就要走了吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40C6E5896CF690F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422314004:1":{"text":"네. 하지만 이번엔 저, 프리다, 탈리, 셋이서 가려고요.","source_cn":"是的，不过这次是我和弗瑞达、塔莉，我们三个一起走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB16CC1D78F47F0E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422314005:1":{"text":"어젯밤에 많은 이야기를 나누었는데 결국 이런 결정을 내리게 되었어요. 제 제련 기술에 하르그의 단조 기술이면 분명 저희만의 세계를 개척할 수 있을 거예요.","source_cn":"昨天晚上我们聊了很多，最后做出了这个决定。我想凭我的冶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x781A589B4385CB67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422314006:1":{"text":"앞으로 어떤 어려움이 닥쳐도 저희 셋이서 함께 마주할 거예요.","source_cn":"以后哪怕遇到什么困难，也是我们三个一起面对了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45A80E16BCC9B469","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422314007:1":{"text":"탈리도 바깥세상을 구경하고 싶어요. 아빠, 엄마에게 제련, 단조, 그리고 악기 연주도 배우고 싶고요!","source_cn":"塔莉也想见识外面的世界，跟爸爸妈妈学冶炼、锻造和弹奏乐器！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14125E90633FAB4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422314008:1":{"text":"친절하신 마법사와 서머너 님, 저희는 바깥세상에서 분명 다시 만나게 될 거예요!","source_cn":"好心的魔法师和魔法使魔，我们一定会在外面的世界再见的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x185D621B21401A13","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"친절하신 마법사와 서머너 님, 저희는 바깥세상에서 분명 다시 만나게 될 거예요!","female":"친절하신 마법사와 서머너 님, 저희는 바깥세상에서 분명 다시 만나게 될 거예요!","variant_male_record_index":"163760","variant_female_record_index":"163761","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:哈尔格":{"text":"하르그","source":"哈尔格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:弗瑞达":{"text":"프리다","source":"弗瑞达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔莉":{"text":"탈리","source":"塔莉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":5